The chains of cnt (0..2) and neg (-6..0, signed) are narrowed to a few bits;
both updates still reach main, so the violation is found. With one bit fewer
per chain (checked by hand on 2026-11-01) the values 2 and -6 no longer fit
and the violation is lost.
